<title>BELGIUM: Belgian May budget deficit widens.</title>
<headline>Belgian May budget deficit widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian federal state's net borrowing requirement widened to 56.2 billion francs in May from 44.3 billion in the year-ago month, the Finance and Budget Ministries said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The cumulative borrowing requirement for the first five months of 1997 widened to 259.9 billion francs from 243.9 billion in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
